    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final2 is an interactive ski route planning application (Abschlussaufgabe 2,
   WS 2025/26).
    - The document task.md describes the assignment 'Abschlussaufgabe 2 — Skiroutenplaner'.
    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final2 uses a CLI command set including load area, plan, set skill, set
  goal, like, dislike, alternative.
    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final2 is supervised by Prof. Dr.-Ing. Anne Koziolek (KASTEL).
    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final2 uses lifts, pistes, user skill and user preferences to compute routes
    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final2 uses an interactive console application interface.
