  (GONDOLA or CHAIRLIFT), start/end times, ride duration and queue time (minutes); a lift is usable
  only if Start ≤ (current time + queue time) ≤ End; Talstation is a special lift used to enter/exit
   the area and each area has at least one Talstation.; Piste entities have a unique identifier,
  difficulty (BLUE, RED, BLACK), surface (REGULAR, ICY, BUMPY), length (meters) and elevation gain
  (meters).
